{"slug":"Universal-Script-Universal-aimbot-esp-hitbox-240872","_id":"6a46ccafcbf194a3cabd08de","title":"Universal aimbot esp hitbox","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"NOTE* THIS SCRIPT IS WIP DONT USE RAYFIELD IN BIGGER GAMES THAT WOULD HAVE ANTI CHEAT FOR HITBOX EXTENDERS DO NOT USE THEM UNLESS YOU CHECK THE GAME WITH AN ALT ACCOUNT THESE TWO THINGS ARE VERY EASY TO DETECT AND MAY GET YOU BANNE,ALSO IF UR AIMBOT IS FLICKING AWAY USE SAFE MODE\notherwise send a comment if a game doesent work ill try to fix it*\n🌟 DANI’S UNIVERSAL HUB 🌟\n\nThe ultimate lightweight powerhouse for Aimbot, ESP, and Hitboxes.\n\nLooking for a script that works everywhere and doesn't lag your game? Dani’s Universal is built for speed, precision, and stealth. Whether you want to look like a pro or go full rage mode, we’ve got you covered! 🚀\n\n⚡ POWERFUL FEATURES ⚡\n\n🎯 ADVANCED AIMBOT\n\nRage Mode: Snap instantly to targets.\n\nSafe Mode: Smooth, human-like tracking to stay under the radar.\n\nTarget Selection: Focus on Head, Torso, or HumanoidRootPart.\n\nNPC Support: Works on players AND NPCs!\n\n👁️ NEW: ENHANCED ESP TAB\n\nTeam Check: Automatically ignores teammates (Green = Friend, Red = Enemy).\n\nVisuals: Player Names, Health Bars, and 2D Box outlines.\n\nTransparency Control: Adjust the fill to your liking!\n\n📏 HITBOX EXPANDER\n\nMake your enemies impossible to miss.\n\nAdjustable size (1–60 studs).\n\nOptional Hitbox ESP so you can see exactly where to shoot.\n\n🎮 CHOOSE YOUR STYLE 🎮\n\n💎 RAYFIELD UI: Best for the \"Aesthetic\" look. Sleek animations, modern design, and easy-to-read sections. If you want your menu to look premium, pick this!\n\n🛡️ CUSTOM UI: The \"Ghost\" option. Extremely lightweight and built with custom code to be less likely to be detected by basic anti-cheats. Perfect for staying low-key.\n\n📱MOBILE UI: WIP(its not the best out there but it works on some games)\n\n⌨️ CONTROLS & INFO ⌨️\n\nOpen/Close Menu: Press [K]\n\nAimbot Key: Right Click (Hold) — Changeable in settings!\n\nDiscord: Pqy4 🤝\n\n❤️ Support the Project! If you enjoy using this script, please leave a LIKE! It helps a ton. Enjoy dominating the lobby! 🔥","tags":["aimbot","esp","wallhack","universal","hitbox"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/momakdobiobannadiscord-maker/Roblox-/main/Universal\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6a0250aada149a80f74837d3","username":"Sweetdreams","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/82ee378412b079612db0d362636fe904b001559799f47e2ebcb0ebfad213ef3b.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a0250aada149a80f74837d3-1783024845717.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6a0250aada149a80f74837d3","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/82ee378412b079612db0d362636fe904b001559799f47e2ebcb0ebfad213ef3b.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a0250aada149a80f74837d3-1783024845717.jpg"}},"verified":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/GMTTmbFJP","views":6539,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/2c967c43acb105853c3c098d335ab1651deeafacd4bd5f0e6febf732ae8b97bb.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1783024815775.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1783024815775.jpg"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T20:40:15.791Z","executes":24076,"keyless":false,"milestones":[{"key":"script.executions","tier":10000,"value":19568,"at":"2026-09-29T05:45:00.006Z"}],"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-14T01:03:17